# Embercleave, which "costs {1} less to cast for each attacking creature you control": {2}{R}{R}, paid by the second Black
# Lotus and Mox Ruby, so the Forest stays untapped (a full {4}{R}{R} could not have been paid at all). Embercleave goes on an
# Elf (2/2 double strike, trample): 4 from it and 1 from the other, Bot2 to 15.

